The player is designed to integrate with an existing media serving architecture, ensuring minimal disruption and adherence to resource usage limits. It dynamically adjusts buffer sizes based on system load metrics from the media server, balancing performance and resource consumption. The player also efficiently handles compressed streams, decompressing them on-the-fly without introducing latency.

