The code also includes a mechanism for handling transient failures, with retry logic that limits retries to no more than three attempts per task, with exponential backoff between retries. The `initialize()` method initializes the logging framework and sets up the service name for logging purposes. The `executeTask()` method logs detailed information about each task execution, including the name of the service being tested, the name of each task, the duration of the task execution, and any error messages if applicable.

