The code is easy to integrate into existing infrastructure with minimal disruption, and supports configuration of timeout periods and maximum retry attempts via environment variables. The `adjustConcurrencyLimit()` method also includes a fallback strategy in case of network failures, which can help mitigate the impact of network latency when executing remote tasks.

