The library and PHP application are thoroughly documented, providing clear interfaces for external use to facilitate seamless collaboration between development teams. Comprehensive logging mechanisms are implemented to monitor memory usage, data access patterns, and operational errors, facilitating trend analysis and anomaly detection. Integration with a distributed messaging system is also provided to send asynchronous notifications during data pruning processes, ensuring data integrity and system reliability.']

