The `init_entry_list` function initializes an empty entry list with a capacity of 10 entries. The `add_entry` function adds a new entry to the list by creating a new `Entry` structure and adding it to the end of the array. If the list needs to be resized, it is doubled in size to minimize overhead during frequent updates.

