This code is designed to work in both single-threaded and multi-threaded environments, balancing between concurrency safety and performance. The `pthread_mutex_t` mutex is used to ensure thread-safe operations on the entry list, while the `add_entry`, `delete_entry`, and `update_entry` functions use a lock-free approach to minimize overhead during frequent updates.

